n his essay \"The Muppetry of Nightmares\" that the idea failed because the characters were irredeemable and unfunny. Nonetheless, \"The Land of Gorch\" had a significant impact on later Henson works, including both the 1982 feature film \"The Dark Crystal\" and the 1991 television show \"Dinosaurs\"."
